  "invariants": [
    "Researcher cannot approve runs or write raw observations; approver is a human principal with explicit permission.",
    "Subject cannot read held-out gold targets. Judge and subject permissions are distinct even when using the same external provider.",
    "PlanVersion body and frozen manifests are immutable. Changed code, data, prompt, model, tools or scorer create a new version and invalidate previous scope.",
    "Confirmation of a paid pilot is separate from discovery allowance and confirmatory experiment approval.",
    "Approval canonical hash, workspace, expiry, remaining run count and budget must match at dispatch.",
    "Budget reserve, actual charges, in-flight and unresolved exposure participate atomically in remaining budget.",
    "Unknown paid-call outcomes are reconciled before any retry; cancellation does not release unresolved reserves.",
    "Silent provider/model fallback is forbidden. Store alias, effective model ID and immutable version only when actually available.",
    "Native SDK billed paths require conformance probe; otherwise restrict SDK to approved discovery preparation.",
    "PostgreSQL transactions persist domain change plus outbox. Event consumers and external side effects are idempotent at their supported boundary, not falsely globally exactly-once.",
    "Temporal orchestration state and PostgreSQL domain projection are different sources for different purposes; reconciler detects divergence.",
    "Repetition-level observations are nested within case; paired bootstrap resamples case clusters, not independent repetitions.",
    "Comparison compatibility hash excludes candidate ID and includes controlled protocol/dataset/scoring/environment conditions.",
    "Reinterpreting a result creates a new FindingVersion/ReportVersion; raw evidence is not overwritten.",
    "Immutable evidence can be legally deleted under retention; tombstones preserve minimal audit without content.",
    "SDK researcher shell and subject execution live in isolated coordinator-managed sandboxes; no host mounts, Docker socket or direct control database access.",
    "A contract-valid demo with placeholder hashes does not pass live artifact validation or provide execution authorization.",
    "Reserved and unresolved exposure are mutually exclusive accounting categories: timeout atomically transfers exposure without double counting or release.",
    "Private Telegram uses getUpdates polling; hosted HTTPS can use webhook. Delivery modes are mutually exclusive for a bot and both deduplicate update_id.",
    "Existing S3 presigned links expire by short TTL or object removal, not imaginary per-link instant revocation. Sensitive downloads use an authorizing proxy."
  ],
